      <a class="address" href={maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="location-icon">⌖</span><span><strong>Visite nossa loja</strong><small>Rua Maria Geralda Valadão, 06 · Parque Enseada<br/>Guarujá – SP · CEP 11443-070</small></span><span class="arrow">›</span></a>
